{"ID":"20260809200341-5hquudw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-5hquudw","title":"腾讯WXG企业微信实习项目面试复习笔记","type":"doc","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-xyn8p63","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xyn8p63","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腾讯 WXG 企业微信实习项目面试复习笔记"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-vzfl68t","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-vzfl68t","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260809200341-8oun6ix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-8oun6ix","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用场景：秋招项目深挖、实习经历复盘、AI 工具 / MCP / Crash 分析 / 数据看板方向面试。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-zjok5i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-zjok5i8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这份笔记按“项目介绍 -\u003e 架构链路 -\u003e 核心问题 -\u003e 满分回答 -\u003e 追问补充”组织，回答口径尽量做成可直接复述的面试话术。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-8bdqgb8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-8bdqgb8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一、三个项目的整体叙述"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xlje3gi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xlje3gi","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这三个项目不是孤立的，而是围绕企业微信 Windows Crash 分析闭环展开："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-wg8n175","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-wg8n175","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"mcp-windbg\n  -\u003e 把 WinDBG/CDB 的 dump 分析能力服务化、MCP 化\n\nwxlog_analyze\n  -\u003e Flutter 客户端工具，接入 mcp-windbg，完成反馈包 / dump 的自动预筛、深度采证、规则归因和结果展示\n\nwxlog_stats_server\n  -\u003e 接收分析归档和用户反馈，提供统计 API、MCP 查询工具和 Web 看板，形成效果复盘闭环\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-zn2hek5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-zn2hek5","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面试时可以这样总述："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-4n7py1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-4n7py1p","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我在企业微信实习期间主要做的是内部 Crash 分析工具链。底层先把 Windows CDB/WinDBG 调试能力封装成一个远程 MCP 服务，也就是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mcp-windbg"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，解决“每个 AI 工具或客户端都要本地安装调试器、手工跑命令”的问题。上层 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"wxlog_analyze"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是 Flutter 客户端，负责读取反馈包、扫描 dump、上传到 CDB 服务、预筛 crash、深度采证，再通过本地确定性规则给出归因和客服话术。最后 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"wxlog_stats_server"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用 JSONL + 内存索引保存分析记录、反馈和统计数据，并通过 REST、Web 看板、MCP tools 给运营和开发查看效果。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-1xygtqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-1xygtqt","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这条链路的核心价值是：把原来依赖人工 WinDBG 经验的 Crash 分析，变成可复用、可解释、可统计的工程化流水线。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-9ctms2y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9ctms2y","updated":"20260809200341"}},{"ID":"20260809200341-3kxrzas","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-3kxrzas","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二、项目一：mcp-windbg"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-bpb5ppl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bpb5ppl","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 项目一句话介绍"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-veh9i3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-veh9i3n","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mcp-windbg"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是一个远程 Windows Crash Dump 分析服务。它把 CDB/WinDBG 的命令执行能力封装成 MCP Streamable HTTP、REST API 和 Web 页面，让 AI 助手、脚本或浏览器都能远程上传 dump、创建调试 session、执行 CDB 命令并拿到结构化结果。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-bv7ubts","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bv7ubts","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 技术栈和模块"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-az8hpai","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-az8hpai","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-ygd344f","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ygd344f","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-bkda3fg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bkda3fg","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务框架：Starlette + Uvicorn，单进程 ASGI 服务。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-m25jx4s","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-m25jx4s","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-j2bj9js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-j2bj9js","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP 协议：FastMCP，暴露 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Streamable HTTP endpoint。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ijpo3qv","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ijpo3qv","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-5mlaaom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-5mlaaom","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调试器：Windows Debugging Tools 里的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cdb.exe"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-5uw4yfz","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-5uw4yfz","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-dyefilb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-dyefilb","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文件管理："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"FileManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 负责 dump/PDB 上传、SHA1 去重、symstore 索引。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-oh2r0ey","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-oh2r0ey","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-q62rl8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-q62rl8q","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会话管理："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SessionManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 维护 CDB 子进程池、session 生命周期和空闲清理。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-sddt3ir","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-sddt3ir","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-a8mzu3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-a8mzu3y","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB 封装："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CDBSession"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 负责启动子进程、发送命令、读取输出、marker 检测命令完成。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-qnxtv7d","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-qnxtv7d","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-p6a446n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-p6a446n","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"API 层：上传接口、REST API、轻量 Web CDB 页面。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-h3aokmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-h3aokmr","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"核心数据流："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-k0l55we","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-k0l55we","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"AI / 客户端\n  -\u003e tool_upload / REST create upload token\n  -\u003e PUT /uploads/{token} 上传 dump\n  -\u003e FileManager 计算 SHA1、去重、落盘\n  -\u003e tool_create_session 创建 CDBSession\n  -\u003e tool_session_exec 执行 quick_triage / !analyze -v / kb 等命令\n  -\u003e 返回输出\n  -\u003e tool_close_session 释放 CDB 进程\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-r60x3ll","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-r60x3ll","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 简历表述"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-9p6voav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9p6voav","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以写："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xpvoqmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xpvoqmh","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在腾讯 WXG 企业微信实习期间，参与建设 Windows Crash Dump 远程分析服务 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mcp-windbg"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。项目基于 Starlette/Uvicorn 和 FastMCP，将 CDB/WinDBG 能力封装为 MCP Streamable HTTP 与 REST API，支持大文件流式上传、SHA1 去重、PDB/symstore 索引、交互式 CDB 会话池、命令级输出隔离和空闲 session 回收，为上层 Crash 分析客户端和 AI Agent 提供稳定的远程调试能力。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-muml2a3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-muml2a3","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 项目 Q\u0026A"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-h7jyjr5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-h7jyjr5","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q1：介绍一下 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mcp-windbg"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这个项目。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-l7b4liq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-l7b4liq","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-08kfzd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-08kfzd2","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目本质上是一个远程 WinDBG/CDB 能力服务化平台。传统分析 Windows crash dump 需要本地安装调试工具、配置符号路径、手工执行 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 等命令，对客服、客户端同学和 AI 工具都不友好。所以我把 CDB 封装成后端服务，提供 MCP、REST 和 Web 三种入口。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-z1t64b3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-z1t64b3","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"核心链路是：用户或 AI 先申请一次性上传 token，然后流式上传 dump；服务端计算 SHA1 做去重并落盘；之后创建 CDB session，底层启动 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cdb.exe -z dump.dmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 子进程；后续命令通过 session 复用这个 CDB 进程执行，最后关闭 session 释放资源。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-yumsmaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-yumsmaj","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它解决了三个问题：第一，调试器能力集中部署，客户端不需要安装 WinDBG；第二，AI 工具可以通过 MCP 直接调用调试命令；第三，dump、符号、session 都有生命周期管理，能支撑上层自动化 crash 分析。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-9zeno86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9zeno86","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"追问补充："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-63aqmne","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-63aqmne","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-sqvoy4m","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-sqvoy4m","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-ku2qwtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ku2qwtv","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不只是简单包一层 shell，而是做了上传、去重、session 池、输出隔离、超时、资源回收。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-d0us8ga","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-d0us8ga","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-0kt1hp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-0kt1hp6","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP 适合 AI 工具接入，REST 适合普通脚本和 Web 页面。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-piin6u5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-piin6u5","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q2：为什么要做成 MCP 服务，而不是客户端直接调用 WinDBG？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-wlvt4h8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-wlvt4h8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-98b9qck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-98b9qck","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要是为了标准化接入、降低环境成本和支持 AI 自动化。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-c4zrp10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-c4zrp10","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果客户端直接调用 WinDBG，每台机器都要安装 Windows SDK Debugging Tools，还要配置符号路径、处理版本差异和权限问题。对于企业内部工具来说，这个维护成本很高。做成服务后，只需要在服务端部署一次 CDB，客户端通过 HTTP/MCP 访问即可。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-vkj7i2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-vkj7i2d","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP 的价值在于它给 AI Agent 提供了标准工具接口。比如 Cursor、Claude Desktop、CodeBuddy 这类工具可以直接发现 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_upload"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_create_session"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_session_exec"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 等工具，不需要为每个 AI 客户端单独写适配。这样上层可以把“上传 dump -\u003e 跑 quick_triage -\u003e 深度分析 -\u003e 总结结论”做成自动化 workflow。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-0rq5gnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-0rq5gnu","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"追问补充："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-jrjnjne","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-jrjnjne","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-ma56ttg","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ma56ttg","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-5ao8q3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-5ao8q3s","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"REST 更通用，MCP 更适合 Agent 工具调用。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-fkdlrty","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-fkdlrty","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-8uz0zkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-8uz0zkz","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务化后也便于统一做限流、日志、权限、审计和符号缓存。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-z7jszrj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-z7jszrj","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q3：整体架构怎么分层？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-umstnb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-umstnb6","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-pboqjfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-pboqjfb","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我按四层理解："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-95dscj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-95dscj2","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一层是入口层，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"main.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"__main__.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 负责 CLI 参数、配置加载、Starlette app 组装、Uvicorn 启动。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-8aih20f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-8aih20f","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二层是协议和 API 层，包括 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的 FastMCP 工具、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/uploads/{token}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上传接口、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/api/*"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" REST 接口和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/cdb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Web 页面。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-0a3eyci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-0a3eyci","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三层是核心业务层，包括 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"FileManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SessionManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CDBSession"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"FileManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 负责文件上传、SHA1 去重、PDB 和 symstore；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SessionManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 管 CDB session 池；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CDBSession"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 封装真正的 CDB 子进程交互。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-yvhbqye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-yvhbqye","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第四层是基础设施层，包括配置管理、目录结构、符号路径、线程池和 CDB 可执行文件路径。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-exp8fry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-exp8fry","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种分层的好处是协议层可以变，比如 REST、MCP、Web 都能复用同一套核心能力；核心层也可以独立测试。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-pxdoc0h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-pxdoc0h","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q4：CDB 是阻塞子进程，为什么不会阻塞整个 ASGI 服务？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-nxd4tv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-nxd4tv2","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-yrp42sj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-yrp42sj","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB 命令执行本身是阻塞的，尤其是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".reload /f"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、加载符号这类命令可能很慢。如果直接在 async handler 里同步执行，会阻塞事件循环，影响其他请求。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-y2c09l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-y2c09l0","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目里用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ThreadPoolExecutor"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 把 CDB 命令执行桥接到线程池里。ASGI 入口仍然是异步的，请求进来后通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"loop.run_in_executor(...)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 把阻塞命令丢到线程池执行，事件循环可以继续处理其他 HTTP 请求。线程池大小和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_sessions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 对齐，避免无限创建 CDB 进程和线程。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-tnlhlo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-tnlhlo7","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以这里的模型是：网络层异步，CDB 执行阻塞但受线程池隔离，资源上限由 session 池控制。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-se8wro8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-se8wro8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"追问补充："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-9r1rpgc","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9r1rpgc","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-e3h179p","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-e3h179p","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-k8gr5jj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-k8gr5jj","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果没有线程池，一个慢 dump 分析会拖慢整个服务。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-665lzgj","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-665lzgj","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-lk05nt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-lk05nt5","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果线程池无限大，又会把机器资源打爆，所以要和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_sessions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 绑定。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-6gqkavd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-6gqkavd","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q5：CDB session 为什么要复用？为什么不每条命令都启动一次？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-kfrje7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-kfrje7g","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-laj3m6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-laj3m6i","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两种模式都有：one-shot 和 interactive session。但深度分析更适合 session 复用。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-wmw17kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-wmw17kb","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每次启动 CDB 都要加载 dump、初始化调试上下文、加载符号，成本比较高。一次 crash 分析通常要连续执行 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".lastevent"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".exr -1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lm"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 等多条命令。其中 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".exr -1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 查看当前异常记录，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 切换到异常上下文。如果每条命令都重新启动 CDB，会非常慢，也会重复加载符号。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-x7x5h0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-x7x5h0u","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"session 复用的做法是：创建 session 时启动一个常驻 CDB 子进程，后续命令通过 stdin 写入，stdout 后台线程持续读取。这样上下文和符号状态都保留，深度分析效率更高。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-w9lc7lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-w9lc7lz","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但复用也带来资源风险，所以项目里限制 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_sessions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，记录 last_activity，后台每 60 秒清理空闲超时 session，最后调用 close 显式释放。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-oym7x5g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-oym7x5g","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q6：你怎么判断一条 CDB 命令执行完成？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-9w43s9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9w43s9k","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-gwxllg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-gwxllg8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不能简单靠读取 stdout 到某个 prompt，因为 CDB 输出不一定稳定，命令可能输出多行、包含进度信息，也可能没有明确 prompt。项目里采用 marker 机制。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-v067uq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-v067uq5","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"发送命令时，会在命令后面追加 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".echo COMMAND_COMPLETED_MARKER"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，后台 reader 线程持续读取 stdout。一旦读到这个 marker，就认为本轮命令输出结束，并通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"threading.Event"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 通知等待方。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-2mztor9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-2mztor9","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后续为了避免连续命令之间输出串扰，又加入了 UUID boundary marker。每条命令会包一层："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-igtb08c","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-igtb08c","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":".echo ===CMD_BOUNDARY_xxx_START===\n\u003c真实命令\u003e\n.echo ===CMD_BOUNDARY_xxx_END===\n.echo COMMAND_COMPLETED_MARKER\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-dly9sut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-dly9sut","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"返回时只截取 START 和 END 之间的输出。这样即使命令执行慢、输出多，也能较可靠地隔离每条命令的结果。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-d1qxfyw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-d1qxfyw","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q7：为什么需要 UUID boundary marker？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-rfd1nxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-rfd1nxn","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-v615uhn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-v615uhn","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为长期交互式 CDB session 中，stdout 是一个连续流。多条命令连续执行时，如果只靠全局完成 marker，可能出现输出污染：上一条命令的尾部、CDB 自身提示、进度输出混入下一条命令。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-z54zwxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-z54zwxy","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UUID boundary marker 的作用是给每条命令生成唯一边界，只提取这条命令边界之间的内容。这样可以做到命令级输出隔离。即使 timeout，只要读到了 START，也可以返回部分输出并标记为 timeout，方便上层做降级。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-tzoq7ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-tzoq7ki","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个设计对 AI 分析尤其重要，因为 AI 很依赖输出准确性。如果输出串了，模型可能基于错误栈做错误归因。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-bhavt1w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bhavt1w","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q8：大文件 dump 上传怎么处理？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-y09u92a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-y09u92a","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-faivyro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-faivyro","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"dump 文件可能几百 MB 甚至 GB 级，不能一次性读进内存。项目里采用两步上传："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-x925n31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-x925n31","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一步，客户端通过 MCP 或 REST 申请 upload token，服务端创建临时目录并记录 token。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-u5zkbkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-u5zkbkd","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二步，客户端 PUT/POST 到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/uploads/{token}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，服务端流式写入临时文件。上传完成后计算 SHA1，判断目标 dump 是否已经存在。如果存在，就删除临时文件并返回 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"already_exists=true"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；如果不存在，就移动到 dumps 目录，文件名用 SHA1。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-0n8d95q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-0n8d95q","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样有几个好处：避免大文件占用内存；token 一次性使用，减少误用；SHA1 去重避免重复上传和重复分析；临时目录和 token 在 finalize 后清理，避免残留。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-9duf62w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9duf62w","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q9：为什么用 SHA1 做 dump 去重？MD5 可以吗？SHA1 冲突怎么办？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-g41lhgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-g41lhgr","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-gzvl5eq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-gzvl5eq","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里 SHA1 主要用于工程去重和文件指纹，不是用于安全签名。相比 MD5，SHA1 碰撞概率更低；对于内部 dump 文件去重，已经足够实用。计算时采用分块读取，不会把大文件一次性加载到内存。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ti4hgon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ti4hgon","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果面试官追问安全性，我会说明：如果这是安全敏感场景，不能只依赖 SHA1，需要升级到 SHA256，或者同时比较文件大小、部分元信息甚至二次校验。但当前场景是内部工具的重复上传识别，SHA1 是性能和可靠性的折中。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-9qmr9kw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9qmr9kw","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q10：符号文件是怎么处理的？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-n3ke28l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-n3ke28l","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-3wilnfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-3wilnfg","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目支持上传 PDB/DLL/EXE 等符号相关文件。PDB 上传后会按关联 dump 的 SHA1 存到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"user_pdbs/{dump_sha1}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 目录，同时后台调用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"symstore.exe"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 把符号索引到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pdb_cache"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-7e39jg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-7e39jg8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里有两个关键点："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-rpr9mp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-rpr9mp9","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一，symstore 是外部进程，可能比较慢，所以可以后台执行，避免阻塞主流程。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xfgd3iz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xfgd3iz","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二，symstore 调用用了类级别锁串行化。因为多个符号文件同时写同一个 symbol store，可能存在并发写冲突或索引损坏风险。串行化牺牲一点并发，但换来符号缓存一致性。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-hi2qgbi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-hi2qgbi","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q11：这个项目有哪些资源保护？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-oc7zpl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-oc7zpl6","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-bg8ipwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bg8ipwe","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要有五类："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-bbykxor","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bbykxor","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-usws4qx","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-usws4qx","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-1un03yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-1un03yx","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上传保护：一次性 UUID token、最大上传大小、临时目录清理、流式写入。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-9542u45","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9542u45","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-p04ijoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-p04ijoc","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文件保护：SHA1 去重，避免重复 dump 占用磁盘。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-8ug5emg","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-8ug5emg","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-p42n7xj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-p42n7xj","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程保护："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_sessions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 限制 CDB 进程数，防止机器被 CDB 打爆。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-tjz2cs8","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-tjz2cs8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-1l0rzob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-1l0rzob","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时间保护：命令级 timeout，空闲 session 定时回收。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-3gil0tl","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-3gil0tl","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-akty0s5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-akty0s5","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出保护：marker 和 UUID boundary，避免输出串扰。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-7t9bjat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-7t9bjat","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果继续做生产化，我还会补鉴权、配额、审计日志、危险 CDB 命令白名单、磁盘水位清理。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-vzfe3xl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-vzfe3xl","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q12：项目里最难的点是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-d8dw46p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-d8dw46p","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-gmwnz8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-gmwnz8x","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最难的点不是启动 CDB，而是把一个面向人工交互的命令行调试器封装成稳定的服务接口。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ejjzel1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ejjzel1","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB 输出是流式文本，不是结构化 API；命令完成没有天然事件；符号加载和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 会慢；dump 文件很大；session 不关闭会泄漏 CDB 子进程。所以我重点做了几个工程化处理：用 marker 判断命令完成，用 UUID boundary 隔离输出，用线程池承接阻塞命令，用 session 池控制资源，用 idle cleanup 自动回收，用流式上传和 SHA1 去重管理大文件。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xdg9v0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xdg9v0e","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面试时我会强调：这个项目的价值在于把“不稳定的人工调试动作”变成“可被 AI 和客户端稳定调用的服务能力”。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-u5z4737","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-u5z4737","updated":"20260809200341"}},{"ID":"20260809200341-e07ev8o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-e07ev8o","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三、项目二：wxlog_analyze"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-8b9dxrz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-8b9dxrz","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 项目一句话介绍"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-pu7ryr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-pu7ryr8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"wxlog_analyze"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是一个 Flutter 桌面端 Crash 分析工具。它支持选择企业微信反馈包 zip、dump 文件或混合输入，自动解压和扫描 dump，通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mcp-windbg"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上传并执行 CDB 预筛和深度采证，再用本地规则引擎输出可解释的 crash 分类、证据、客服话术，并把分析结果归档到本地和统计服务。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-r2u78cj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-r2u78cj","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 主链路"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-qsix9i3","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-qsix9i3","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"CrashAnalysisWindow\n  -\u003e CrashAnalysisManager\n  -\u003e crash_pipeline_input 扫描 zip/dmp/mixed 输入\n  -\u003e CrashMcpBridge 上传 dump、创建 session、执行 quick_triage\n  -\u003e CrashLocalRuleEngine.groupBySignature 分组\n  -\u003e CrashLocalDeepAnalyzer.runDeepCollection 深度采证\n  -\u003e CrashLocalRuleEngine.analyze 规则归因\n  -\u003e MemoryCrashLogAnalyzer 内存 crash 日志补强\n  -\u003e AnalysisArchiveService 本地 JSONL + HTTP 上报\n  -\u003e UI 展示结论、话术、反馈入口\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-w6e0njw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-w6e0njw","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 核心设计点"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-bk13i2b","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bk13i2b","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-7f0z23t","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-7f0z23t","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-eb2sxin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-eb2sxin","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入归一化：支持 zip、dmp、zip+dmp 混合输入，统一变成 dump 路径列表。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-9puigml","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9puigml","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-9zh4ntc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9zh4ntc","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"zip 解压隔离：解压和写盘放到 Dart isolate，避免阻塞 UI isolate。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-1vj61io","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-1vj61io","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-jzkae5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-jzkae5w","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"dump 去重：本地 SHA1 去重，避免重复上传和重复分析。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-v4q5013","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-v4q5013","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-ooaguk8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ooaguk8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预筛限流："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"prefilterCrashDumps"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 默认并发 2，最多保留 5 个 crash 候选。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-uxjp6we","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-uxjp6we","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-3lk9u5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-3lk9u5e","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"quick triage：通过 MCP 调 CDB 快速判断 crash / suspected / non-crash。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-9zo7c2e","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-9zo7c2e","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-6q4urlv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-6q4urlv","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分组分析：相同 crash 签名合并，只对代表 dump 做深度分析。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-meb2oyz","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-meb2oyz","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-0u7ncmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-0u7ncmm","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"确定性规则：本地规则引擎优先级匹配，不依赖 LLM，结果可复现、可测试。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-bz3safq","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bz3safq","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-knhzbm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-knhzbm9","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存专项：对 bad_alloc、0xc0000017 等内存信号反查企业微信日志。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-sygwi1x","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-sygwi1x","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-6m9x5k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-6m9x5k6","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"fail-soft：zip、CDB、归档、日志补强部分失败时尽量保留主结果。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-46e2p7c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-46e2p7c","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 简历表述"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-tl02933","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-tl02933","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以写："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-lf13m4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-lf13m4v","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参与企业微信 Crash 分析客户端 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"wxlog_analyze"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 建设，基于 Flutter 实现反馈包 / dump 输入、异步解压、dump 扫描、MCP 调试服务接入、quick triage 预筛、CDB 深度采证、本地规则归因、内存 crash 日志补强和分析结果归档。针对批量 dump 场景设计了 SHA1 去重、并发窗口、候选上限、crash 签名分组和 session 生命周期管理，提升内部 Crash 分析效率和结果可解释性。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-69xnr73","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-69xnr73","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 项目 Q\u0026A"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-g198nbb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-g198nbb","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q1：介绍一下 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"wxlog_analyze"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-tk75yh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-tk75yh8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-841zapb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-841zapb","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是一个企业微信内部 Crash 分析客户端工具，主要给客服和开发同学分析用户反馈包里的 Windows crash dump。用户可以选择 zip 反馈包、单独 dump 或混合输入。工具会自动解压 zip、扫描 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".dmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".pdb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".dll"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 等文件，把 dump 上传到远程 CDB MCP 服务，然后先执行 quick triage 预筛，筛掉非 crash dump，再对候选 crash 做深度采证和本地规则归因。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-farb3vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-farb3vh","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最终 UI 会展示 crash 分类、证据链、命中的模块、置信度和建议话术，并把结果写到本地 JSONL，同时异步上报统计服务。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-asy8u43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-asy8u43","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目的重点不是单纯调用 AI，而是把 crash 分析做成稳定的工程流水线：输入归一化、预筛、采证、规则归因、内存日志补强、归档统计都有明确边界。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-gw465e8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-gw465e8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q2：为什么不用 LLM 直接分析 dump，而要做本地规则引擎？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-1uqffs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-1uqffs1","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xo5l58k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xo5l58k","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 crash 归因对稳定性和可解释性要求很高。LLM 可以辅助总结，但不能作为唯一判定来源。比如第三方 DLL 命中、企业微信自身问题、系统 OOM、CEF 资源缺失，这些都需要可复现的证据链。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-13xe663","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-13xe663","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本地规则引擎的好处是："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-1ys8085","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-1ys8085","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-ewcfxpm","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ewcfxpm","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-aqzm47d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-aqzm47d","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可复现：同样输入一定得到同样结论。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-8s670av","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-8s670av","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-my614u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-my614u0","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可解释：每个分类都有 evidence list 和话术来源。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-0faycfc","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-0faycfc","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-rm3qwqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-rm3qwqh","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可测试：新增规则可以写单元测试，避免回归。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-dk2i2vv","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-dk2i2vv","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-6qiicun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-6qiicun","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可控：规则优先级由代码明确控制，不依赖模型随机性。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-wayj73y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-wayj73y","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以当前主链路是 CDB 采证 + 本地规则归因。LLM/CLI 链路在项目中保留，但当前 UI 主路径不依赖它。这样更适合企业内部工具落地。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xzkq5eh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xzkq5eh","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q3：输入处理怎么设计？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-3yfxm3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-3yfxm3w","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xa5qhmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xa5qhmp","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入层把三种输入统一成一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CrashInputScanResult"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-jbl9jqe","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-jbl9jqe","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-qmkzi4k","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-qmkzi4k","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-87v9plp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-87v9plp","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"zip 反馈包：先计算 zip SHA1，然后解压到系统临时目录 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CrashAnalyze/\u0026lt;fingerprint\u0026gt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，递归扫描 dump 和符号文件。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-k7n1xwl","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-k7n1xwl","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-d74l6iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-d74l6iy","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"dmp 列表：校验文件存在，按修改时间排序，并用最新 dump 的 SHA1 作为 source fingerprint。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-k78vpqv","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-k78vpqv","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-zopmofb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-zopmofb","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"zip + dmp 混合：先处理 zip 分支，再处理 dmp 分支，最后合并 dump 和符号文件列表。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-0z7zn0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-0z7zn0v","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样上层 Manager 不需要关心用户到底选的是 zip 还是 dump，只消费统一的 dump 路径列表。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-rwxi3q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-rwxi3q8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外，zip 解压放到 isolate 里做，因为 zip 解码和写盘可能比较重，如果放在 UI isolate 会导致界面卡顿。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-taz9032","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-taz9032","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q4：为什么 zip 解压要用 isolate？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-3tcooq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-3tcooq4","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-uqla9k0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-uqla9k0","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Flutter 桌面应用主 isolate 负责 UI 渲染和事件响应。如果大 zip 的读取、解码、写盘都在主 isolate 执行，用户会看到界面卡住。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-32rtbph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-32rtbph","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目里用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Isolate.run"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 把 zip 解压放到后台 isolate。主 isolate 只等待 Future 完成，并继续保持 UI 响应。解压结束后再回到主流程扫描 dump。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-uaeklpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-uaeklpw","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是一种比较实用的性能保护：不一定提升总耗时，但能提升交互体验，避免内部工具看起来“假死”。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-25w720o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-25w720o","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q5：预筛流程怎么做？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ymzgp02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ymzgp02","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-f5zzbmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-f5zzbmr","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预筛的入口是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"prefilterCrashDumps"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。它对 dump 列表做滑动并发窗口调度，默认并发度是 2，最多保留 5 个 crash 候选。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-lqo4stu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-lqo4stu","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单个 dump 的流程是："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-r8j2y7r","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-r8j2y7r","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-r5phhs8","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"1.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-r5phhs8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-f0j1qzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-f0j1qzd","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"校验本地文件存在。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-6ur4de8","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"2.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":2,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-6ur4de8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-v1ejuvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-v1ejuvx","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"计算本地 SHA1，做去重。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-7tedvjz","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"3.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":3,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-7tedvjz","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-mnhya1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-mnhya1v","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调 MCP 服务申请上传 token。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ywqof4l","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"4.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":4,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ywqof4l","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-upo1vrr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-upo1vrr","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上传 dump。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-6wcy903","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"5.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":5,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-6wcy903","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-zzpcpx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-zzpcpx5","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建 CDB session。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-qe56vfr","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"6.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":6,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-qe56vfr","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-twpp77g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-twpp77g","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"执行 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"quick_triage"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-qnrwg8d","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"7.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":7,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-qnrwg8d","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-m48hf9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-m48hf9e","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根据 last_event、exception_record、stack_frames 判定 crash / suspected / non-crash。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-l6aut58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-l6aut58","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"非 crash dump 会立即关闭 session；候选 dump 的 session 会保留给后续深度分析；如果候选已经满 5 个，多余 session 会立即关闭，避免服务端资源泄漏。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-5z52zqx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-5z52zqx","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q6：为什么预筛默认并发 2，候选最多 5 个？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-dsy6g71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-dsy6g71","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-wwklhz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-wwklhz6","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是性能和稳定性的折中。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-iee0top","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-iee0top","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预筛每个 dump 都会上传文件、创建 CDB session、执行 quick triage。CDB 是重资源，MCP 服务端也有 session 上限。如果完全串行，批量反馈包会很慢；如果并发太高，又可能压垮 CDB 服务。所以默认并发 2，相当于小窗口并发，能提升吞吐又不会造成太大压力。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xo0rgz5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xo0rgz5","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最多 5 个候选是因为反馈包里可能有很多历史 dump，但真正需要深度分析的通常只是一小部分。对所有 dump 都跑 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 成本太高，而且用户也不需要几十个重复结论。保留 5 个候选，再按 crash 签名分组，可以覆盖主要问题并控制耗时。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-gqjue4t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-gqjue4t","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q7：quick triage 是怎么判断非 crash dump 的？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-7cnkdrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-7cnkdrq","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ci3nnic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ci3nnic","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"判定不是简单看有没有栈，而是综合 last_event、exception_record、stack_frames。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-msbac24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-msbac24","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"强 crash 信号是 last_event 有真实异常码，并且异常码不是 benign break code，同时 exception record 或 stack 有有效证据。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-rcz3pqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-rcz3pqv","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"非 crash 的典型情况是手动 dump、断点、卡顿采样 dump。比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0x80000003"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这类调试中断，或者栈里出现 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"NtDelayExecution -\u0026gt; Sleep -\u0026gt; client_extension -\u0026gt; UnhandledExceptionFilter"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的卡顿采样特征，就不能当成真实 crash。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-hdxx63w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-hdxx63w","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有 suspected 场景，比如异常模块命中初始化失败相关模块，但证据不够强，就先作为疑似 crash 候选进入后续深度分析。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-x8ympvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-x8ympvh","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个设计可以减少误报，避免把卡顿采样 dump 当成 crash。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-4q17peg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-4q17peg","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q8：深度分析采集哪些证据？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-1yzaq39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-1yzaq39","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xttdz8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xttdz8e","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"深度分析由 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CrashLocalDeepAnalyzer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 负责，它只做采证，不做最终归因。主要从 CDB/MCP 拉取几类信息："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-eyhf4gh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-eyhf4gh","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-8ccb7wc","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-8ccb7wc","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-un2q5p5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-un2q5p5","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异常信息，比如 exception code、exception address。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-0l8ut8t","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-0l8ut8t","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-d17o0ga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-d17o0ga","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块列表，用来判断命中模块属于企业微信、第三方还是系统。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-odzlxz9","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-odzlxz9","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-wiq07p4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-wiq07p4","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异常上下文栈，比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr; kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-2cnu8e0","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-2cnu8e0","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-zg3somb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-zg3somb","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"WinDBG 自动分析结果，比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xgjj993","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xgjj993","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-h588e7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-h588e7w","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"必要时通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lmvm \u0026lt;module\u0026gt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补查 DLL 路径。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ojqcygz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ojqcygz","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采集结果汇总成 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"DeepCollectionResult"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，交给本地规则引擎消费。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-743bfev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-743bfev","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样分层后，采证层不掺杂业务判断，规则层也不关心 MCP HTTP 细节，边界比较清晰。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-naxfjnw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-naxfjnw","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q9：规则引擎怎么归因？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ug0puwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ug0puwz","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ni8dwk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ni8dwk7","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"规则引擎主要做两件事：先分组，再归因。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-vmisv9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-vmisv9w","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分组是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"groupBySignature"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，根据 quick triage 里的异常码、模块、函数等信息构造 crash 签名。先做精确分组，比如“异常码 + 模块 + 函数”；再做宽松合并，比如“异常码 + 模块”。这样相同问题只分析代表 dump，避免重复跑 CDB 深度命令。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ygz0lrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ygz0lrd","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归因是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"analyze(collection)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，按优先级匹配规则。比如数据缺失、硬件问题、CEF 资源缺失、第三方模块命中、堆损坏 / 函数指针异常、企业微信自身问题、无法分析等。规则是先命中先返回，返回结果包含 classification、置信度、证据列表和话术。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ls2xp9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ls2xp9s","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种设计最大优点是可解释和可测试。面试里可以强调：这不是让模型猜，而是基于 CDB 证据做确定性归因。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-o8r4dbt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-o8r4dbt","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q10：内存 crash 为什么要单独做日志补强？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-xr8b796","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-xr8b796","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-16gk6k0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-16gk6k0","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存类 crash 只看 dump 栈经常不够。比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"bad_alloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 或 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0xc0000017"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 可能是系统内存不足，也可能是企业微信自身虚拟地址耗尽，还可能只是某个分配点触发了表象。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-i5pqv14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-i5pqv14","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以项目里有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MemoryCrashLogAnalyzer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当规则层发现明确内存信号时，会反查反馈包里的企业微信日志，提取 Memory、sys、MemoryInspector、Environment 等相关指标，判断是系统 OOM、企业微信内存溢出、虚拟地址耗尽，还是证据不足。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-d0fpphn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-d0fpphn","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样能避免只根据栈顶函数做粗糙判断，也能让客服话术更准确。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-uqhgbgg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-uqhgbgg","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q11：为什么要把归档失败设计成不影响主流程？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-kwv3iym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-kwv3iym","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-lflcqnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-lflcqnw","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为这个工具的主目标是给用户展示 crash 分析结果。归档和统计是后置能力，如果服务器不可用、网络抖动或本地写入失败，不应该导致用户这次分析失败。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-en5ilw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-en5ilw6","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"AnalysisArchiveService"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的策略是：先尽量写本地 JSONL，再 fire-and-forget 异步 POST 到统计服务；feedback 和 remark 也是先更新本地，再异步上报。HTTP 失败只在 debug 下打印，不向主流程抛异常。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-yq6zdgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-yq6zdgn","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这属于 fail-soft 设计：核心链路尽量产出结果，非核心链路降级。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ficuxvk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ficuxvk","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q12：项目里有哪些设计模式？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-m80cfwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-m80cfwp","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-2ntxi6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-2ntxi6c","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要有："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-o1nu7dt","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-o1nu7dt","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-lxkgo55","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-"