dren":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以它不是 demo 式功能，而是更接近内部真实工具的工程化流水线。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-ws6q4yh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-ws6q4yh","updated":"20260809200341"}},{"ID":"20260809200341-y699vda","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-y699vda","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四、项目三：wxlog_stats_server"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-co5u3ts","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-co5u3ts","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 项目一句话介绍"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-y2owhgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-y2owhgf","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"wxlog_stats_server"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是 Crash 分析结果的统计归档服务。它接收 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"wxlog_analyze"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上报的分析记录、用户反馈和备注，使用按用户分片的 JSONL 文件持久化，并维护内存索引用于快速查询、分类统计、反馈有效率、月度趋势和 Web 看板展示，同时也暴露 MCP tools 供 AI 查询统计数据。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-kyisrqs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-kyisrqs","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 技术栈和模块"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-bqp43td","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bqp43td","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-zhs0yk9","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-zhs0yk9","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-870q2rf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-870q2rf","updated":"202608092