"updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q75：如何保护客户端本地的分析历史？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-tk178w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-tk178w4","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-6j5va97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-6j5va97","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本地历史只保存必要元数据和脱敏证据，设置保留期、清理入口和可选加密。不要默认长期保留原始 dump 路径和完整日志。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-36gt2tx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-36gt2tx","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"展开点："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-bxxln8r","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bxxln8r","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-kcqukog","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-kcqukog","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-4oqw0i0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-4oqw0i0","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"删除应同步清理关联临时目录。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-4p1a5dk","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-4p1a5dk","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-aef93y6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-aef93y6","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"导出报告前要再次检查敏感字段。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-7p8tj9q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-7p8tj9q","updated":"20260809200341"}},{"ID":"20260809200341-l56yi1q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-l56yi1q","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十七、专项补充题库：wxlog_stats_server 的一致性、指标与治理"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-bo55phu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-bo55phu","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q45：为什么创建记录和修改反馈需要不同的幂等键？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-0tg09o8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-0tg09o8","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-qp8mjaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-qp8mjaa","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建记录强调“同一次分析不要重复计数”，适合用分析 id 或来源指纹；反馈修改强调“最后一次有效操作”，适合带版本或更新时间。两类操作的冲突语义不同。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-5u6sfe0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-5u6sfe0","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"展开点："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-36fah1r","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-36fah1r","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-pv2rrmh","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-pv2rrmh","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-h7a3t6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-h7a3t6r","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不能用同一个简单 hash 覆盖所有更新。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-o4kl6n2","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-o4kl6n2","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-h3diy44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-h3diy44","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反馈更新可使用乐观版本号避免丢写。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-oq8v3e2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-oq8v3e2","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q46：如何避免两个反馈请求互相覆盖？"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-uoghgjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-uoghgjv","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"满分回答："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-384pbmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-384pbmk","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"记录带 revision，客户端更新时携带期望 revision；服务端不一致则返回冲突，让客户端刷新后再提交。用户锁保证文件写入串行，revision 保证业务语义正确。"}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-hn6qqy4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-hn6qqy4","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"展开点："}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-39ax57b","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-39ax57b","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-eicfmsi","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-eicfmsi","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-gnm80hj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-gnm80hj","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只加锁不能解决陈旧客户端覆盖新反馈。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-kd41ltb","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-kd41ltb","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260809200341-mg8jagv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260809200341-mg8jagv","updated":"20260809200341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注也应定义追加还是覆盖语义。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260809200341-r32wm2k","Type":"Nod